on and none  of it will happen without railroad  workers who've been working without a  contract for two years now with no  raises an emergency team from the white  house will offer its recommendations in  the next two weeks in hopes of heading  off a railroad strike in september  for cbs mornings i'm carter evans in los  angeles
 

